      22.5
    ],
    "cameraTranslation": [
      0,
      0
    ],
    "cameraAutoFrame": true,
    "cameraAutoFramePadding": 4,
    "cameraAutoFrameMaxAttempts": 6,
    "emptyValueToken": "none",
    "maxCombos": 1000
  },
  "notes": [
    "Generate variant assets with --dynamic-icon-id-prefix AH_DynamicIcon. Default-only assets are maintained directly under Server/Tamework/DynamicIcons.",
    "Every generated variant config specifies a default portrait. Entries sharing roles merge in order, with mod variants before vanilla variants.",
    "Only major visual slots multiply the icon count. renderAttachmentDefaults supplies representative omitted anatomy/details without constraining icon matching.",
    "Pinned installed archive versions are intentional; review slot selections and counts when refreshing a source."
  ],
